    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>This hat has 3 charges. While holding it, you can take a Magic action to expend 1 charge and summon your choice of a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmBat00000000000]{Bat}, a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmFrog0000000000]{Frog}, or a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmRat00000000000]{Rat}. The creature magically appears in the hat and tries to get away from you as fast as it can. It is Indifferent toward you and other creatures and isn’t under your control: it behaves like an ordinary creature of its kind and disappears after 1 hour or when it drops to 0 Hit Points. The hat regains all expended charges daily at dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-ab6mNIWl1m3IMWoB\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Summon Vermin</em> place la créature choisie, qui n’obéit pas à son invocateur : le MJ la joue.</p></section>",
